# Python engines of the containerized document worker (and nothing else).
# Direct pins match uv.lock; requirements.txt locks the rest by hash.
# Regenerate it after a change:
#   uv pip compile deploy/document-worker/requirements.in --python-version 3.11 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes \
#     -o deploy/document-worker/requirements.txt
# Not here on purpose: httpx (remote parse egress stays in the Kazma process,
# and the worker has no network), docling/torch (the local salvage tier is
# not part of the container profile), psutil (Windows-only tree cleanup).
